  "description": "Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL backend for Durable ORM: store entities as JSON documents with the full IRepository surface, LINQ filters, ordering, paging and aggregates pushed down to parameterized Cosmos DB SQL queries where the semantics match C#, lossless value round-trips, configurable partition keys, ETag-based optimistic concurrency without lost updates, includes and counter-document auto-increment keys.",
